[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_5C_ACCORD]
Accord Tower

[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_5C_ACCORD_desc]
Take heed of thine command, forsooth, ye who haveth determinede to wipe outen disorder and chaos, shalt anon breden the dismal harmonye that ruineth every fre sprite, whyle ther be naught left to stande in fronten of the mindless thronge to wield the whippe.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_5C_ACCORD]
有序之塔

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_5C_ACCORD_desc]
慎戒汝之命令，汝等自命要铲除无序与混沌，必将然生育出毁灭每一自由灵魂之凄凉有序，而再无任何存在能够立于无心之众前以挥动鞭绳。
